  "idea": "Automated sprint retro board with anonymous feedback collection",
  "text": "The continuous improvement framework that makes remote engineering teams ten percent faster every sprint. Most distributed teams treat retros like venting sessions, producing zero documented fixes for chronic bottlenecks. Without automated issue tracking, team complaints vanish the second developers disconnect from the call. Metro Retro collects anonymous insights, groups common friction, and converts voted solutions into Linear tickets. This compounds team delivery speed with zero added chaos.",
